    {
        "content": "<p>myunbin opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14327\">PR #14327</a> from <code>myunbin:add-rules-260914</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Add new mid-end optimization rules:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>x &lt;&lt; (k &amp; (B - 1)) ==&gt; x &lt;&lt; k</code></li>\n<li><code>x &gt;&gt;u (k &amp; (B - 1)) ==&gt; x &gt;&gt;u k</code></li>\n<li><code>x &gt;&gt;s (k &amp; (B - 1)) ==&gt; x &gt;&gt;s k</code></li>\n<li><code>uextend(x) &lt;u uextend(y) ==&gt; x &lt;u y</code></li>\n<li><code>x %s P == 0 ==&gt; (x &amp; (P - 1)) == 0</code> (constant power-of-two P &gt; 0)</li>\n<li><code>(x &gt;=s 0) &amp; (x &lt;s N) ==&gt; x &lt;u N</code> (constant 0 &lt; N &lt; 2^(B - 1))</li>\n<li><code>x %u (1 &lt;&lt; k) ==&gt; x &amp; ((1 &lt;&lt; k) - 1)</code></li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 624084312,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1789397618
